  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'KEEP YOUR HEADLIGHTS ON. TRUST YOUR EYES, NOT EVERY SIGN.


    The load
    is fighting you. Tow your physically attached trailer between the containment
    depots. Stop both tractor AND trailer at each ward and HOLD ACTION to contain
    its cargo. Haunted sway, brakes and shifting weight affect real momentum. Keep
    the load intact and deliver it to the final depot.


    Movement uses your assigned
    driving controls. ACTION braces a tipped cursed load using physical restoring
    torque; otherwise ACTION away from a station toggles headlights. Each human keeps
    an independent truck and camera. Cooperative variants share objectives and never
    award individual winner points. Eliminated participants spectate surviving trucks.
    Rematch restores the whole venue, cargo and encounters. Default match: four minutes.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
